Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `sq` is an instance method on `Point`
  --> tests/ui/instance_on_type.jet:7:25
    |
  7 | run: fn() { print(Point.sq()) }
    |                         ^^
 Why: Instance methods need a value before the dot
 Fix: Call it on a `Point` value: `x.sq(...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
